<title>USA: ASV Inc Q4 sales gain fuels net increase.</title>
<headline>ASV Inc Q4 sales gain fuels net increase.</headline>
<dateline>GRAND RAPIDS, Minn. 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>ASV Inc said Wednesday a surge in sales of its track-driven vehicles helped earnings double in the fourth quarter ended December 31.</p>
<p>The company said net income reached $318,308, or $0.06 a share, compared to $149,797, or $0.03 a share, one year ago.</p>
<p>Sales in the period rose to $3.6 million from $2.4 million in the fourth quarter of 1995.</p>
<p>ASV makes all-season vehicles and related accessories.</p>
<p>Its shares closed down 1-1/4 Wednesday at 22-1/4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
